{"Title":"An Act relative to notification of licensees","BillNumber":"H380","DocketNumber":"HD346","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T12:35:46.477"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T12:35:46.4766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H380/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Puppolo of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 380) of Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr., relative to notifications to licensees of applications for the sale of alcoholic beverages.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 15A of chapter 138 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2010 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting in line 49 after the word “exercised” the following words: and to all section 15 licensees in that city or town.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}